* [ ]	No obsolete Transform glyph or presentation code remains.
* [ ]	Saved layouts containing its old ID load safely.
* [ ]	Current documentation and localization match the new controls.
* [ ]	All remaining attacks, movement, and defensive systems still work.
* [ ]	The complete automated test suite passes.
* [ ]	Any unavailable manual verification is explicitly reported.

